  "title": "Linked Chests",
  "description": "Effortless linked storage — access the same inventory from any chest, any place, any time!",
  "body": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Linked Chests</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> adds shared storage channels that can be accessed from matching chests placed anywhere in the world. Set a chest’s channel with three dye colours, then open any chest using the same combination to reach the same inventory. 🎨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The mod is useful for bases, outposts, mines, farms, and multiplayer storage networks where travelling back to one storage room slows everything down. For private storage, channels can also be locked to a player, giving you a larger personal inventory space that only follows you. 🔒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A linked pouch lets you access a chosen channel directly from your inventory, making the system practical while exploring, building, or moving items between locations. 🎒</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dye-Based Channels:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Create unique linked storage networks using three dye colours. Configure channels directly on the chest or craft dyes into linked chests and pouches.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shared Remote Storage:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Any linked chest with the same channel opens the same inventory, no matter where it is placed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Personal Channels:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Convert a channel into player-specific storage for private access with double the inventory space.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Linked Pouch:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Carry portable access to a selected linked chest channel from anywhere.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Easy Channel Copying:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Sneak-use a linked pouch on a linked chest to bind it to that chest's channel.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hopper Compatible:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Fully supports hoppers and other automation for easy item transport and storage systems.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Visual Channel Feedback:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Chests and pouches display their selected dye colours, making channels easy to identify at a glance.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">INSTALLATION REQUIRED ON CLIENT &amp; REQUIRED ON SERVER</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">REQUIRES </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> TO BE INSTALLED (FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">REQUIRES </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> TO BE INSTALLED (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">REQUIRES </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> TO BE INSTALLED (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">If available for a mod, configuration is possible directly from in-game using the mod menu (requires </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> by </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> to be installed on Fabric).</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">For manual configuration using an external text editor all files are found at </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, named as </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, or </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, depending on the type of config. Not all types might exist for a mod, if any at all.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Thanks to </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kyrptonaught\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kyrptonaught</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> and their </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-storage\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Linked Storage</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> mod for serving as a founding for this project. Linked Chests originally started out as a port, but has since turned into a complete standalone rewrite.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Thanks to </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chicken_bones\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chicken_Bones</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> for inspiring this project with their </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-storage\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ender Storage</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> mod.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Thanks to the incredibly talended </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mim1q\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mim1q</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> for creating all those amazing textures.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/portable-hole\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/portablehole/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shroomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/straw-statues\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/leave-my-bars-alone\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavemybarsalone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vehicle-upgrade\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/armor-quick-swap\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armorquickswap/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hovering-hotbar\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoveringhotbar/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-anvils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">© 2026 @heyitsfuzs. All rights reserved. This page was last edited on 11 September 2026, at 06:44 (UTC).</span></p>\n",
